      "Added data to db: https://whatfix.com/ with metadata: {'buyer': 'https://sprinto.com/', 'category': 'Social & Community Signals', 'data': \"Sprinto has actively engaged in various events and webinars, highlighting their commitment to cybersecurity and compliance. Key activities include:\\n\\n- **Masterclass: Betting Big on Security**  \\n  In this session, Aron Lange, Founder of LearnGRC, and Girish Redekar, Founder of Sprinto, discussed leveraging security as a growth enabler, emphasizing strategies to showcase a strong security stance and instill a security-first culture. ([sprinto.com](https://sprinto.com/event-masterclass-security-accelerate-growth/?utm_source=openai))\\n\\n- **Bytes & Budgets: Navigating Downturns as a CISO**  \\n  Held on April 25, 2025, this virtual event featured top CISOs sharing insights on balancing security needs with budget constraints, offering strategies for managing budgets while maintaining robust cybersecurity programs. ([sprinto.com](https://sprinto.com/register-today/?utm_source=openai))\\n\\n- **Webinar Participation**  \\n  Aarthisri Srinivasan, Events Marketer at Sprinto, appeared on Zuddl's podcast, sharing expertise on hosting successful B2B webinars and discussing current trends and practices in the field. ([zuddl.com](https://www.zuddl.com/podcast/podcast-episode-15-host-successful-b2b-webinars?utm_source=openai))\\n\\nThese engagements reflect Sprinto's proactive approach to addressing current cybersecurity challenges and their dedication to educating and collaborating within the industry. \", 'summary': 'Sprinto emphasizes cybersecurity and compliance through various events and webinars, showcasing their dedication to industry education and collaboration. Notable activities include:\\n\\n1. **Masterclass: Betting Big on Security**  \\n   - Focused on using security as a growth enabler.\\n   - Discussions by Girish Redekar from Sprinto and Aron Lange from LearnGRC on strategies to boost security culture.\\n   - Relevant Source: [Sprinto Masterclass](https://sprinto.com/event-masterclass-security-accelerate-growth/?utm_source=openai)\\n\\n2. **Bytes & Budgets: Navigating Downturns as a CISO**  \\n   - Virtual event on balancing security with budget constraints.\\n   - Strategies for maintaining robust cybersecurity amid financial challenges.\\n   - Relevant Source: [Sprinto Bytes & Budgets](https://sprinto.com/register-today/?utm_source=openai)\\n\\n3. **Webinar Participation with Zuddl**  \\n   - Aarthisri Srinivasan discussed hosting successful B2B webinars and current trends.\\n   - Relevant Source: [Zuddl Podcast Episode](https://www.zuddl.com/podcast/podcast-episode-15-host-successful-b2b-webinars?utm_source=openai)\\n\\nThese initiatives demonstrate Sprinto’s proactive stance on cybersecurity issues and commitment to advancing industry standards.\\n\\n**References:**\\n\\n- [Sprinto Masterclass](https://sprinto.com/event-masterclass-security-accelerate-growth/?utm_source=openai)\\n- [Sprinto Bytes & Budgets](https://sprinto.com/register-today/?utm_source=openai)\\n- [Zuddl Podcast Episode](https://www.zuddl.com/podcast/podcast-episode-15-host-successful-b2b-webinars?utm_source=openai)'}\n",
