      "Rippling is a San Francisco-based company operating in the business products and software services industry. Founded in 2016 by Parker Conrad, Rippling offers a comprehensive workforce management platform that integrates human resources (HR), information technology (IT), and finance functions into a single system. ([forbes.com](https://www.forbes.com/companies/rippling/?utm_source=openai))\n",
      "\n",
      "**Product Overview:**\n",
      "\n",
      "Rippling's platform provides businesses with tools to manage various employee-related tasks, including:\n",
      "\n",
