      "\n",
      "- **Compliance Risks:** Integrated compliance features help businesses adhere to regulatory requirements across different jurisdictions.\n",
      "\n",
      "**Recent Developments and Strategic Goals:**\n",
      "\n",
      "As of April 2024, Rippling achieved a valuation of $13.5 billion following a $200 million funding round led by Coatue Management. The company has experienced significant growth, with revenue doubling annually and reaching approximately $350 million in annual recurring revenue in 2023. ([reuters.com](https://www.reuters.com/technology/hr-tech-startup-rippling-valued-135-bln-after-latest-fundraise-2024-04-22/?utm_source=openai))\n",
