      "3. **Financial Growth and Sustainability:** Despite being unprofitable, Rippling holds over $1 billion in cash reserves and aims to continue its rapid revenue growth while working toward profitability. The company is also providing liquidity options for employees through stock buybacks. ([reuters.com](https://www.reuters.com/technology/hr-tech-startup-rippling-valued-135-bln-after-latest-fundraise-2024-04-22/?utm_source=openai))\n",
