      "Whatfix is a digital adoption platform (DAP) that enhances user engagement and maximizes the benefits of software applications. Founded in 2013, the company is headquartered in San Jose, California, with additional offices in Bengaluru, India, and other global locations. ([en.wikipedia.org](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Whatfix?utm_source=openai))\n",
