      "**Industry and Company Overview**\n",
      "\n",
      "Operating within the software and information technology sector, Whatfix specializes in providing in-app guidance, training, and performance support for web, desktop, and mobile applications. The company has experienced significant growth, with a reported revenue between $100 million and $250 million and a workforce of approximately 900 employees. ([datanyze.com](https://www.datanyze.com/companies/whatfix/375294615?utm_source=openai))\n",
